From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BDK Patches <patches@bdk.invalid>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 11:03:05 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] bdk: export the BDK engine's test hooks from the framework

The BDK engine has test hooks (//bdk/engine/bdk_testing.h in the BDK
repository): scripted navigations served without the network, UI requests
raised for the application's own handler, script run with a user
gesture, synthetic clicks, a count of pending work and a count of the
windows Chromium opened by itself, where a page's tab is (its host
context and tab identifier), and one command hook,
bdk_testing_command, behind which sit everything else the engine tests
need: scripting the default presenters, driving find in page, reading
preferences and site settings, capturing a page, and what the operating
system's authentication prompt and the download policy answer. The
conformance suite and the engine scenario tests run against the packaged
runtime through them, so the framework must export them. They are not
the C ABI and give a page nothing: each acts as the application, on its
own pages.

List them in chrome/app/framework.exports and, before _ChromeMain, in
framework.order.

Used by: packages/core/tests/harness_engine.mm and the engine scenario
tests in the BDK repository.
---
 chrome/app/framework.exports | 17 +++++++++++++++++
 chrome/app/framework.order   | 17 +++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 34 insertions(+)

diff --git a/chrome/app/framework.exports b/chrome/app/framework.exports
index ce3e661d2855e812fecaec12d238421534040364..7536e8295d42b457849f96c03f3b36d704ac7a3e 100644
--- a/chrome/app/framework.exports
+++ b/chrome/app/framework.exports
@@ -117,3 +117,20 @@ _bdk_window_set_request_handler
 _bdk_window_unregister
 _OBJC_METACLASS_$_BDKApplicationBase
 _OBJC_CLASS_$_BDKApplicationBase
+
+# BDK: the engine's test hooks (//bdk/engine/bdk_testing.h). Not ABI.
+_bdk_testing_chrome_window_count
+_bdk_testing_click
+_bdk_testing_command
+_bdk_testing_execute_script
+_bdk_testing_forget_profiles
+_bdk_testing_host_context_count
+_bdk_testing_intercept_all
+_bdk_testing_last_ui_outcome
+_bdk_testing_pending_work
+_bdk_testing_raise_ui_request
+_bdk_testing_run_for
+_bdk_testing_script_navigation
+_bdk_testing_simulate_key
+_bdk_testing_tab_info
+_bdk_testing_withdraw_ui_requests
diff --git a/chrome/app/framework.order b/chrome/app/framework.order
index 749941f6c402d1fcbed2c108f5eb4f00993eb0b8..c5795773c28e7c977c16174888ed5c8b83f83986 100644
--- a/chrome/app/framework.order
+++ b/chrome/app/framework.order
@@ -126,6 +126,23 @@ _bdk_window_set_anchor_provider
 _bdk_window_set_request_handler
 _bdk_window_unregister
 
+# BDK: the engine's test hooks.
+_bdk_testing_chrome_window_count
+_bdk_testing_click
+_bdk_testing_command
+_bdk_testing_execute_script
+_bdk_testing_forget_profiles
+_bdk_testing_host_context_count
+_bdk_testing_intercept_all
+_bdk_testing_last_ui_outcome
+_bdk_testing_pending_work
+_bdk_testing_raise_ui_request
+_bdk_testing_run_for
+_bdk_testing_script_navigation
+_bdk_testing_simulate_key
+_bdk_testing_tab_info
+_bdk_testing_withdraw_ui_requests
+
 # _ChromeMain must be listed last.  That's the whole point of this file.
 _ChromeMain
 
